{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06793","headline":"奉赠张荆州 · 王昌龄","name":"奉赠张荆州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祝融之峯紫云衔，翠如何其雪崭嵓。\n邑西有路缘石壁，我欲从之卧穹嵌。\n鱼有心兮脱网罟，江无人兮鸣枫杉。\n王君飞舄仍未去，苏耽宅中意遥缄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}